# PTCS 0.2.37 exact dependency cascade

## Plan

- 背景：PTCS agent inbox delivery authority新增public boundary、claim/defer/complete與Host JSON contract。
- 目標：將active Dynamic PTCS adapters同步到exact PTCS 0.2.37，依序build/pack/push，供PTCS Host避免assembly skew。
- 不得改變：Dynamic Contracts/Renderer schema與既有SDUI行為；不更新legacy ACL/Login複本或LiveDemo。
- 範圍：`PulseTrade.Comm.Spa.Dynamic.Ptcs`、`PulseTrade.Comm.Spa.Dynamic.Ptcs.Client`及active aggregate `PulseTrade.Comm.Spa.Dynamic`。
- 假設：PTCS 0.2.37已發布且其public API為本輪canonical dependency；Dynamic schema與renderer不需行為調整。
- 風險：若active consumer仍鎖0.1.14，restore會重新引入PTCS 0.2.27 exact constraint並造成runtime assembly skew。
- 驗收：Release build成功、NuGet push成功或明確skip-duplicate、PTCS Host使用同一exact dependency graph編譯。

